{"id":"en_airing-their-dirty-laundry","title":"Airing Their Dirty Laundry","titleEn":"Airing Their Dirty Laundry","description":"On the day he is set to celebrate his engagement, Bentley discovers his future mother-in-law, Cynthia, in bed with Derek York, a friend from her childhood. Before he can reveal what he has seen, a staged accident takes his life. But Bentley is reborn on that same day, now armed with live broadcasting. He discreetly gives the illicit pair an aphrodisiac and streams their intimate encounter to every guest on the list. His pursuit of revenge does not stop there, as his investigation reveals a dark scheme involving Derek and his father. Bentley uses this opening to eliminate Derek for good, leaving his fiancée's family consumed by regret.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/airing-their-dirty-laundry/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/airing-their-dirty-laundry/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Affair","Comeback Story","Drama","Engagement Breakup","Father-and-Daughter","Reborn"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db6e6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_airing-their-dirty-laundry_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db6e6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_airing-their-dirty-laundry_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db6e6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_airing-their-dirty-laundry_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db6e6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_airing-their-d